Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Annotations are written with their contents, name, date,
 flags, colour, border dash array, structure parent, opacities, blend mode,
 language, appearance streams and state, and a link's highlight mode and quad
 points; a non-link annotation the writer cannot serialize throws
 Writer.Error.unsupportedAnnotation instead of losing its entries
 (swift-iso/swift-iso-32000#14)

